  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x1007">
    <title>Limiter torque return rate (c_tqi_n_max_inc)</title>
    <description>c_tqi_n_max_inc | not released: only ms45_check.py --expert accepts changes | risk low&#013;&#010;Stock: 5 to 5 Nm&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Limits how fast the controller output rises again. Stock 5 Nm per 10 ms.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;No effect on bouncing in the model, but a second review thinks it may affect the return. Therefore not released.</description>
